                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iOKpr3hpR63o8gssz"><p>2021</p></div
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text icXLVDqx1hQBVTz20"><p>The world&apos;s first ritual replacement device</p></div
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iHYrVI9izGx5eyJvl"
                  ><p>We created Lio, a natural aromatherapy device that replaces the ritual without the poison.</p><p></p><p>Not a vape. Not nicotine replacement. Something entirely different: <strong>behavior replacement.</strong></p
                  ><p></p><p>Plant essences that satisfy the hand-to-mouth motion your brain is seeking. Some loved it immediately. Others thought we were crazy. But many of them stuck with it, far more than those who tried willpower alone.</p><p></p><p>We were onto something.</p></div
