                  ><p>Word spread. Not through flashy ads or influencers, through real people who&apos;d tried everything and finally found something that worked.</p><p></p><p>We served customers in 46 countries we&apos;d never advertised in. People were sharing Lio because it actually helped them, not because we paid them to.</p><p></p><p>Meanwhile, we obsessed over the details. Airflow mechanics. Device ergonomics. Flavor chemistry.</p><p></p><p>Every millimeter mattered because <strong>if the ritual didn&apos;t feel right, people wouldn&apos;t stick with it</strong>.</p></div
                ></div
              ></div
            ></div
          ></div
        ></div
