                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iGVUJ7H2NPOECFIHM"><p>2023</p></div
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iVF4bIEoUevyh83xv"><p>Scale and refinement</p></div
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iMvQkQ3iLWnY1ZgT3"
                  ><p>10,000 customers became 50,000. Then 75,000.</p><p></p><p>The feedback was consistent:</p
                  ><ul
                    ><li><p>Far better results than willpower alone</p></li
                    ><li><p>€2,400 average savings per customer</p></li
                    ><li><p>Most people felt different within the first 72 hours</p></li></ul
                  ><p></p><p>But we also learned where we were failing.</p><p>Flavor fatigue. Clunky refills. Accessibility in markets beyond Europe. So we went back to the drawing board.</p><p></p><p>New plant formulations. Redesigned core mechanism. International expansion, all while maintaining our zero-nicotine, zero-chemical promise.</p></div
