                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iJJQGDADzQiYYGes8"><p>The upgrade</p></div
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iZGrJcodNvUMheCdo"
                  ><p>We launched Lio Gen 2 with everything we&apos;d learned.</p><p>Stainless steel construction. Adjustable airflow. Improved flavor delivery. A modular design that makes it feel less like a "quit tool" and more like <strong>an upgrade to a better ritual</strong>.</p><p></p><p>Because that&apos;s what this really is. Not deprivation. Not willpower. Not fighting yourself.</p><p></p><p>It&apos;s giving your brain what it actually wants, without the harmful substances. 100,000 customers across 50+ countries. But the metric we care about most: <strong>80,000 people who&apos;ve made the switch</strong>.</p></div
