                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ibTEy8l09a9x0AExC"><p>The mission accelerates</p></div
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ivjd2cciQYPfj0QuJ"
                  ><p>The tobacco industry has stolen decades of life from billions of people. </p><p></p><p>Vaping companies said they were the solution, then created an even more addictive delivery system.</p><p></p><p>We&apos;re done waiting for them to fix the problem they created.</p><p></p><p>Our goal: <strong>Help 100 million people break free by 2030</strong>.</p><p>Not through nicotine replacement. Not through willpower.</p><p>Through ritual replacement, the same strategy humans have used for 4,000 years.</p><p></p><p>We built community programs. Developed audio coaching. Expanded globally. And relentlessly improved the device that&apos;s already helped 100,000 people change their habits.</p></div
